Frosty Dreams Ice Cream
A premium, colorful, and responsive ice cream shop website built with React, Vite, Tailwind CSS, and React Router.

Live Demo
https://.github.io/frosty-dreams/

Project Overview
Frosty Dreams Ice Cream is a modern e-commerce-style storefront for an ice cream brand. It includes:

Premium hero section
Responsive navigation
Product catalog and category filters
Product detail page
Build-your-own custom box experience
Shopping cart with persistent localStorage
Demo checkout flow
Order confirmation page
Contact and newsletter sections
Mobile-friendly responsive design
Tech Stack
React
Vite
Tailwind CSS
React Router
Lucide React
Local Storage
Features
Modern premium design with pastel colors and dessert-inspired UI
Product cards with pricing, labels, and ratings
Build-your-own box customization
Demo checkout system with validation
Persistent cart using browser localStorage
Responsive layouts for desktop, tablet, and mobile
GitHub Pages deployment ready
